            "review_title": "Review at Rou Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Yan Cui Travel\n253 contributions\n0\nOne of the best place where vegetarians prefer to visit\nSep 2019 • Solo\nI did give a try at this restaurant because of my cousin's recommendation. For my very first meal there, I ordered 1 plate of boiled vegetables served with 3 types of dipping sauces and 1 bowl of curry soup. Such wonderful vegetarian dishes! I was totally convinced and understood why the restaurant has become one of the best place where vegetarians prefer to visit. I was impressed by their Buddhism ambience and music which made diners like me feel calm and relaxing.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 16, 2020",
