            "review_title": "Review at Rou Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Brett\nMosman Park, Australia126 contributions\n0\nExcellent vegetarian\nJan 2020 • Couples\nYou can be a bit hard in the city to find a good vegetarian fair. Some of the religious restaurants are okay but not very good in the food steaks. This is a small vegetarian diner which is serving dare I say world-class vegetarian food. If you are a vegetarian and you are in Saigon then I will highly recommend this restaurant.\nThe decor and the service are also very good and it is a safe thing to bring somebody here.\nDishes that I would recommend are the wontons, and the stirfried noodles with lots of different vegetarian things that I don’t even know what they are but they had delicious.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 6, 2020",
